18<sup style="line-height: 11px; font-size: 11px;">^</sup>.<br><br></font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><b>To join and take advantage of this offer contact the Qantas Business Rewards Service Centre on 13 74 78</b>.</font></td></tr><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tbody><tr></tr></tbody></table><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tbody><tr></tr></tbody></table><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tbody><tr></tr></tbody></table><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tbody><tr></tr></tbody></table><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tbody><tr></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" align="left" class="w100perc" style="margin: 0px auto;"><tbody><tr><td width="6" align="right" valign="top" style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 0px; font-size: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px; width: 6px; border: 0px;"><a href="https://www.qantasbusinessrewards.com/offer/qantasclub-sale" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); border: 0px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><img src="http://loyalty.qantas.com/imgproxy